1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Important decisions fail when objection,
evidence, and authority never meet.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,500
HumanWire brings them into one workflow.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,600
A manager asks for tomorrow's
launch decision.

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,600
HumanWire selects the minimum
necessary stakeholder path.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,200
One Caspian gateway coordinates
the selected roles.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,000
Anika flags a rollback risk.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,500
HumanWire opens one focused interview.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Her answer becomes shareable evidence
after confirmation.

9
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Confirmed evidence revises the proposal.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Sofia approves the revised plan.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,700
Only then does Daniel
provide availability.

12
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:45,700
HumanWire builds a
meeting-ready result.

13
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:50,400
Replay preserves every saved event.

14
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:58,500
JSON and CSV expose matching records.

15
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:08,400
Caspian is the configurable,
consented-delivery boundary.

16
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:20,000
Standard agents · no external messages
HumanWire · Decision-ready
